 r←Test_ProcessTool_011(stopFlag batchFlag);rc;parms;n;⎕TRAP;buffer
⍝ Exercise "ProcessTool". Specifies additional data via the "data" property and performs a column sort.
 r←∆Failed
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')

 parms←#._APLGUI.GUI.ProcessTool.CreateParms
 parms.posn←30 40
 parms.style←#._APLGUI.GUI.Enums.SelectionStyles.multi
 parms.checkboxes←1
 parms.colTitles←'No' 'Filename'
 buffer←(⍕¨1000+⍳20),[0.5]⌽10⍴¨,¨20⍴⎕A
 parms.data←,[0.5]buffer[;0]

 n←parms #._APLGUI.GUI.ProcessTool.Create buffer'∆DealWithData'
 ⎕DL 0.3
 ⎕NQ n.List'ColumnClick' 1 1 0
 →PassesIf(,[0.5]n.List.Items)≡n.∆data

 r←∆OK

∆TidyUp:
 n.∆CloseForm
